<title>USA: Ferro says settles river cleanup case.</title>
<headline>Ferro says settles river cleanup case.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferro Corp said on Thursday that it, along with two other companies, have signed a $5.3 million settlement agreement with the U.S. Department of Justice and the Indiana Department of Environmental Management for further cleanup of the Grand Calumet River.</p>
</text>
